    "note": "Signed act (04/28/2023). Section 1 repeals a part of Title 13 whose contents are not in the text read; the summary says it limited product-liability suits against firearm and ammunition makers. Sections 6-27-101 to 103 (short title, declaration, definitions) and 6-27-106 are not quoted. The declaration cites the federal 'Protection of Lawful Commerce in Arms Act' as preserving state authority; it does not require the step, so no higher_law_duty."
